// "Corniche Cannelle": a cinnamon canyon (issue #107), the reference circuit of the guide
// « Conception des circuits » (docs/GAME_DESIGN.md). Issue #164: more technical and more vertical
// (Max: « plus de virages, de verticalité »). Original layout, about 2000 m a lap, turning
// right, from 3 m under the river to 42 m up: along the rim, 16 m above the canyon's floor, with
// few walls (a drop where a side has none: the pelican drops a kart that fell before the
// stretch); a bump on the start straight; a risky jump across the inside of a tight corner; a
// glide down to the floor, over the river; a ford under its water; a switchback back up the
// canyon's wall, the S (two hairpins of 180° back to back) and a steep climb in anti-gravity to
// the lookout, 42 m up; the top road back over the S on a bridge (the road passes over itself), a
// bump before it, a drop of 6 m after it, down in anti-gravity; a hidden road behind a needle of rock, while the road goes round it; a
// grass bridge across the last corner, worth it with a boost. Seven big turns of 165° and more
// (four hairpins of 180°, one on the floor, a long turn to the left, the switchback: a Normal bot
// drifts them), the bulge's (right 150° between two left 75°: an S both ways), two tight corners
// of 90°: no long soft curve, one long straight.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them). Issue #164: the points 0-115 and the tail (211-248) are those of before, the
// middle (116-210) is new; the generator is not in the repository.
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Corniche Cannelle",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the canyon (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time (seed), and
    // pieces placed by hand: checkered flags at the start line (beyond the posts of its arch), a
    // giant needle of rock that hides the hidden road, another one by the tight corner.
    biome: "Corniche",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "hot-roadway",
    decor_seed: 107,
    // Issue #211: the canyon's terrain (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), and it hugs the road: the rim,
    // 16 m above the canyon's floor, the switchback and the S back up its wall, the climb and the
    // top are carried by the rock up to their walls, which falls away from them (`embank`, rise
    // over run: about 31°), instead of the skirts down to the floor. Its sides without walls keep
    // their drops (6 m under the road at least, 16 m beyond the edge), the gap of the glide its
    // void, the river its ground.
    terrain: (height: 62.0, scale: 150.0, cliffs: 0.85, terrace: 14.0, floor: 0.25,
              rock: (0.72, 0.40, 0.28), steep: 0.7, embank: 0.6),
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.0, radius: 0.9, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "nature-kit/rock_tallH", at: 219.216, side: Right, height: 22.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 8.0),
        (model: "nature-kit/rock_tallJ", at: 54.204, side: Left, height: 24.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 2.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
    points: [
        // 0-13: the start straight on the rim, 16 m above the canyon floor, heading north (a bump): the one long
        // straight (the slipstream, the items). The grid sits behind point 0.
